  "prefLabel": "Ins 1302.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 1302.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to establish requirements and standards for continuing education programs for a person licensed as a:\n\n(a) Resident producer;\n\n(b) Public adjuster; and\n\n(c) Insurance claims adjuster.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Ins 1300) #8934, eff 8-1-07; ss by #10862, eff 8-1-15; ss by #13546, eff 1-31-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins1300.html"
